/* Timestomp detection for Elastic (EQL, Sysmon Event ID 2 via Winlogbeat).
   ATT&CK T1070.006. Mirrors detections/sigma/. Field names follow the ECS
   Sysmon mapping; adjust to your ingest pipeline.

   EQL is used (not KQL) because catching a rollback needs to compare two
   timestamp fields, which KQL alone cannot do. */

/* $SI creation rolled back: the new creation time predates the previous one. */
file where event.code == "2"
  and not process.name in ("robocopy.exe", "xcopy.exe", "7z.exe", "WinRAR.exe", "tar.exe", "wbengine.exe")
  and winlog.event_data.CreationUtcTime < winlog.event_data.PreviousCreationUtcTime
